  "prefLabel": "Rev 2601.07 Net electrical consumption",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2601.07 “Net electrical consumption” means the gross electrical consumption less the KWH consumed and billed to customers who pay the tax directly to the state pursuant to RSA 83-E:6.\n\nSource. #7479, eff 4-24-01; ss by #9443, eff 4-1-09; ss by #12138, eff 3-22-17",
